<title>USA: Fidelity Emerging Asia shares tendered.</title>
<headline>Fidelity Emerging Asia shares tendered.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Advisor Emerging Asia Fund Inc on Tuesday said it would repurchase about 844,709 of the 4,689,609 shares tendered in response to its offer to repurchase up to 10 percent of its common stock.</p>
<p>It will buy shares accepted for tender at $15.86 per share, less a repurchase fee of 0.85 percent.</p>
<p>The proration for each tendering shareholder is 17.31802 percent of the shares properly tendered.</p>
<p>After the repurchase offer is completed, the fund will have about 7,602,384 shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
